{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "七道关",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 79.76,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先把这条路画出来。",
   "spoken": "先把这条路画出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.078
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "假设一位用户，要从交易所提走 2 万 USDT。这是示例。",
   "spoken": "假设一位用户，要从交易所提走 2 万 USDT。这是示例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.5,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 3.5,
   "speechEnd": 8.453
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "第一关，业务意图。用户点下提现，账本里多了一张提现单。",
   "spoken": "第一关，业务意图。用户点下提现，账本里多了一张提现单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 8.84,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 8.943,
   "speechEnd": 13.867
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "第二关，请求构造。钱包后台把这张单子，翻译成一笔待签名的交易。",
   "spoken": "第二关，请求构造。钱包后台把这张单子，翻译成一笔待签名的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 14.34,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 14.34,
   "speechEnd": 20.378
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "第三关，风控与审批。规则检查金额和地址，大额还要有人批准。",
   "spoken": "第三关，风控与审批。规则检查金额和地址，大额还要有人批准。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 20.8,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 20.8,
   "speechEnd": 26.509
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "第四关，显示与解码。审批的人看不懂原始字节，他看到的，是翻译出来的文字。",
   "spoken": "第四关，显示与解码。审批的人看不懂原始字节，他看到的，是翻译出来的文字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 26.94,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 27.032,
   "speechEnd": 34.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "第五关，签名。可能是 MPC 节点，可能是硬件加密机，也可能是多签的签名人。",
   "spoken": "第五关，签名。可能是 MPC 节点，可能是硬件加密机，也可能是多签的签名人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 34.92,
   "dur": 8.48,
   "speechStart": 35.018,
   "speechEnd": 43.151
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "第六关，广播。签好的交易，发到链上。",
   "spoken": "第六关，广播。签好的交易，发到链上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 43.62,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 43.62,
   "speechEnd": 47.082
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "第七关，链上状态。余额变了。有时候，账户的代码和权限，也会跟着变。",
   "spoken": "第七关，链上状态。余额变了。有时候，账户的代码和权限，也会跟着变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 47.52,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 47.52,
   "speechEnd": 53.975
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "还有一条支线。有些系统要先读链上数据，再决定签不签。这些数据，来自 RPC 节点。",
   "spoken": "还有一条支线。有些系统要先读链上数据，再决定签不签。这些数据，来自 RPC 节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 54.38,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "speechStart": 54.38,
   "speechEnd": 62.243
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "注意每一个箭头。下游都默认，上游已经检查过了。",
   "spoken": "注意每一个箭头。下游都默认，上游已经检查过了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 62.68,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 62.777,
   "speechEnd": 67.268
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "从意图到链上，这整条链路，叫做签名路径。",
   "spoken": "从意图到链上，这整条链路，叫做签名路径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 67.7,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 67.7,
   "speechEnd": 72.064
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "私钥，只待在第五关。攻击者要的，只是让第五关，签出他想要的东西。",
   "spoken": "私钥，只呆在第五关。攻击者要的，只是让第五关，签出他想要的东西。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 72.48,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 72.48,
   "speechEnd": 78.328
  }
 ],
